Data: RESECT, Case 1. Yiming Xiao, Ingerid Reinertsen and colleagues, 2017.
Source: https://doi.org/10.11582/2017.00004
Dataset record: https://archive.sigma2.no/dataset/5D6BFC33-F58D-4F56-88E8-C40AF269D6F2
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Changes: ultrasound images were Gaussian filtered at 0.25 mm and resampled to a common 0.5 mm grid over the union of the before/after acquisition extents. World geometry is retained. Landmark coordinates are unmodified. Only source coordinates are included in agent inputs. Source target coordinates are retained in the separate verifier.
Reference: Xiao Y et al. REtroSpective Evaluation of Cerebral Tumors (RESECT): A clinical database of pre-operative MRI and intra-operative ultrasound in low-grade glioma surgeries. Medical Physics. 2017. doi:10.1002/mp.12268.
